{"code":"021650","name":"한국큐빅","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"자동차부품","sector_desc":"완성차에 들어가는 부품 제조. 완성차 생산량과 전동화(EV) 전환 속도, 환율의 영향을 받습니다.","desc":"동사는 1989년 Curl-fit 공법을 이용한 곡면표면처리업을 목적으로 설립되고, 2003년 코스닥에 상장됨. 2009년 자동차 외장재 부문을 주력사업으로 삼는 삼신화학공업(주)을 자회사로 편입하여 자동차 내장재와 외장재를 함께 운영함. 내장재는 CURL-FIT 기술로 원목 대체 표면처리를 제공하고, 외장재는 라디에이터그릴, 엠블럼, 가니쉬 등을 완성차 및 1차벤더에 납품하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-26","n_days":298,"close":1820.0,"open":1797.0,"high":1842.0,"low":1762.0,"volume":3113,"amount":5665660.0,"ret_1d":0.0,"gap":-1.2637,"range_pct":4.3956,"ret_5":-4.0084,"ret_20":-8.3123,"ret_60":-18.018,"ret_120":-23.0444,"ret_250":-19.1111,"ma20":1918.5,"ma60":1989.1833,"ma120":2048.325,"ma200":2159.87,"close_vs_ma200":-15.7357,"close_vs_ma60":-8.5052,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":-35.4043,"r2_60":0.7681,"slope_120":-22.6571,"r2_120":0.505,"slope_250":-18.655,"r2_250":0.6605,"high52":2510.0,"low52":1762.0,"pos_52w":7.754,"dd_52w":-27.49,"mdd_1y":-27.49,"atr14_pct":3.2418,"vol_ann_60":20.9756,"vol_avg20":5215.2,"vol_ratio20":0.5969,"vr5":1.619,"vr20":0.4504,"amount_avg5":12802319.6,"amount_avg20":9945557.35,"amount_avg60":8886658.9333,"obv_chg20":-44.2217,"turnover_20":0.6379,"pv_eff_20":-13.0303,"rsi14":28.2039,"frgn_net_5":433.0,"inst_net_5":0.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.0026,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":0.0026,"frgn_net_20":-795.0,"inst_net_20":0.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":-0.0049,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0,"smart_net_20_pct":-0.0049,"frgn_net_60":7311.0,"inst_net_60":0.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":0.0447,"inst_net_60_pct":0.0,"smart_net_60_pct":0.0447,"frgn_net_120":10487.0,"inst_net_120":0.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":0.0641,"inst_net_120_pct":0.0,"smart_net_120_pct":0.0641,"foreign_ratio":4.35,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":-0.08,"smart_buy_streak":2,"op_income_q":10.0,"op_margin_q":1.8484,"op_qoq":-41.1765,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":-72.2222,"rev_yoy":-12.7419,"op_trend_4q":-4.4444,"fin_period":"202606","roe":3.98,"debt_ratio":67.11,"per":7.62,"pbr":0.3,"div_yield":5.5,"foreign_rate":4.35,"targ